# Root-level overview of environment configuration.
# Each app manages its own .env — copy the templates below and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit actual .env files or secrets.
#
#   apps/api/.env.example       -> apps/api/.env       (NestJS backend config, DB connection)
#   apps/desktop/.env.example   -> apps/desktop/.env   (Electron/Vite renderer config — API URL only)
#
# The desktop app must NEVER contain database credentials or a DATABASE_URL.
# It only ever talks to the API over HTTPS.
